 ('Organization','Companies|Branches|Warehouses|POS terminals|Financial periods|Currencies|Document sequences|Multi-branch scoping|Multi-warehouse scoping','companies; branches; warehouses; pos_terminals; financial_periods; currencies; document_sequences','/api/v1/admin/company; /api/v1/admin/branches; /api/v1/admin/warehouses; /api/v1/periods','Periods and source numbering; no editable balances','Warehouse ownership and scope','Company tax identity'),
