 ('Inventory','Product master|Categories|Brands|Units|Barcodes|Pricing|Product taxes|Inventory balances|Inventory movements|Stock transfers|Stock counts|Stock adjustments|Inventory valuation|Weighted average valuation|Batches|Serials|Expiry|Reservations|Concurrent stock operations','products; categories; brands; units; product_barcodes; inventory_movements; inventory_balances; stock_transfers; stock_counts','Not implemented','Stock/GRNI/COGS/variance accounts through central posting','Authoritative movements; no direct balance edits','Historical product tax snapshots'),
 ('Customers and AR','Customers|Walk-in customer|Customer accounts|Credit limits|Payment terms|Customer ledger|AR|Customer statements|Aging|Customer payments|Payment allocations|Customer credit notes|Customer debit notes','customers; ar_transactions; payment_allocations; sales','Not implemented','AR control reconciles to customer subledger','Linked sales/return effects','Invoice and credit-note tax linkage'),
