 ('Payments','Cash payments|Bank payments|Card payments|Cheques|EFT|Mobile money|Configurable payment methods|Full payment|Partial payment|Split payment|Advance payment|Unallocated payment|Payment allocation|Payment reversal|Payment idempotency','payment_methods; payments; payment_allocations; payment_attempts','Not implemented','Clearing/bank/cash versus AR/AP/deposits; linked reversal','No direct stock adjustment','Tax only at applicable source/tax-point workflow'),
